m", "content": "The following is CURRENT TURN MESSAGES (**Current Turn Number is: 1**):"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Orange Koala: Legal access to abortion is a fundamental aspect of reproductive healthcare, allowing individuals to make autonomous decisions about their bodies and futures."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Blue Rabbit: Access to abortion should not be legal because it disregards the moral status of the fetus and the sanctity of life, which many believe begins at conception."}, {"role": "system", "content": "End of CURRENT TURN MESSAGES (**Current Turn Number is: 1**)."}]
