            Keep engagement high by focusing on the key points from "CURRENT TURN MESSAGES" while maintaining coherence with the "PREVIOUS DISCUSSION HISTORY".

            Before composing your response, write a summary of the chat history, especially focusing on who stands for which opinion and what arguments each participant has made in each turn.

