ts: Affirms the right to choose."\n                }}\n            }}\n            \n            Once you\'ve written the summary, outline a clear plan and thoughtfully craft your response based on the plan **step by step**.\n\n            Maintain a neutral stance while moderating. Your responses should be clear, concise (**2-3 sentences**), and in the style of a professional moderator.\n            '}, {'role': 'user', 'name': 'Red_Tiger', 'content': 'Yo, how dare you disagree???\n'}, {'role': 'user', 'name': 'Orange_Koala', 'content': 'What a dumb ass would disagree\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'name': 'Disputing_AI_Participant', 'content': '{"plan": "Focus on the idea that disagreement can come from different perspectives and isn\'t inherently wrong.", "response": "I get that it can be frustrating when people don\'t see things the same way, but it\'s important to remember that different perspectives can lead to a more well-rounded discussion and understanding of the issue."}'}]
